<a class="viewer-user" id="viewer-top-avatar" href="/me?community=board%20fixture#vd-profile" aria-label="Viewer account" title="Open viewer account"><span class="viewer-user-avatar" id="viewer-top-mark"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/></svg></span><span><strong id="viewer-top-name">Account</strong></span><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></a></div></header>
<aside class="viewer-rail" aria-label="Viewer navigation">
<details class="viewer-switch"><summary aria-label="Select community"><strong>Ampersand &amp; Board</strong><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="viewer-switch-menu"><p>Your selected community</p><a href="/board%20fixture">Ampersand &amp; Board</a><a href="/me?community=board%20fixture">Switch community <svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/></svg></a></div></details><nav class="viewer-destinations" aria-label="Community pages"><a href="/board%20fixture"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 10 9-7 9 7v11h-7v-7H9v7H3Z"/></svg>Home</a><span class="viewer-nav-unavailable" aria-disabled="true" title="Public activities are not available yet"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4v5H4v-5a2 2 0 0 0 0-4Zm10 0v3m0 3v2m0 3v3"/></svg><span>Activities<small>Not available yet</small></span></span><a href="/board%20fixture/leaderboard" aria-current="page"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3h8v7a4 4 0 0 1-8 0ZM8 5H4v3a4 4 0 0 0 4 4m8-7h4v3a4 4 0 0 1-4 4m-4 2v6m-4 1h8"/></svg>Leaderboard</a><a href="/board%20fixture/shop"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="5" rx="1.5"/><path d="M5 12v9h14v-9M12 7v14m0-14C7 8 4 3 7 2c3-1 5 5 5 5Zm0 0c5 1 8-4 5-5-3-1-5 5-5 5Z"/></svg>Rewards</a><a href="/board%20fixture/me"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>My Activity</a></nav>

<div class="viewer-sidebar-bottom"><blockquote>A &amp; B<cite>— Ampersand &amp; Board</cite></blockquote><div class="viewer-rail-account"><a class="yr-btn yr-btn--sm" href="/board%20fixture/me">Sign in</a><a id="viewer-communities-link" href="/me?community=board%20fixture"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/></svg>My communities</a><a id="viewer-account-link" href="/me?community=board%20fixture#vd-profile" hidden><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/></svg>Viewer account</a></div><a href="/help/support?audience=viewer&amp;return=%2Fboard%2520fixture%2Fleaderboard"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.7 9a2.4 2.4 0 1 1 4.2 1.5C13 11.2 12 11.5 12 13m0 3h.01"/></svg>Help &amp; contact</a></div>
</aside>
<main class="viewer-main" id="main-content">
<section class="yr-lbh">
<h1 class="yr-h1 yr-lbh-title">Leaderboard</h1>
<p class="yr-lbh-note">Ranked by wagered. Tied players share a rank.</p>
</section><section class="viewer-season"><h2>Q&amp;A Leaderboard</h2><p>Standings for Ampersand &amp; Board</p><p class="yr-lbh-meta"><span class="yr-lbh-state is-live">Live</span><span>Q&amp;A leaderboard</span></p></section>
<div data-player-board>
<div class="yr-panel yr-lb">
<div class="yr-panel-head yr-panel-head--quiet"><h2 class="yr-sr">Standings</h2><span class="yr-panel-meta"><span data-player-count-badge>2 players</span></span></div>
<div class="yr-search-row"><label class="yr-sr" for="yr-search">Search players</label><input class="yr-search" id="yr-search" type="search" placeholder="Search players by name" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search" /></div><div class="yr-stand-head" aria-hidden="true" data-hide-prizes="false"><span>#</span><span>Player</span><span class="yr-r">Wagered</span><span class="yr-r">Prize</span></div>
<ol class="yr-stand" data-rows aria-label="Standings for Ampersand &amp; Board" data-value-label="Wagered" data-prize-label="Prize" data-hide-prizes="false"><li class="yr-srow yr-srow--first" data-player-name="alice &lt;3" data-position="1">
<span class="yr-srow-rank"><span class="yr-sr">Rank </span>1</span>
<a class="yr-srow-name" href="/board%20fixture/player/Alice%20%3C3"><span class="yr-player-mark" aria-hidden="true">AL</span><span class="yr-player-name">Alice &lt;3</span></a>
<span class="yr-srow-val"><span class="yr-sr">Wagered: </span>$5,000</span>
<span class="yr-srow-prize"><span class="yr-sr">Prize: </span>$100</span>
</li><li class="yr-srow yr-srow--top" data-player-name="bob" data-position="2">
<span class="yr-srow-rank"><span class="yr-sr">Rank </span>2</span>
<a class="yr-srow-name" href="/board%20fixture/player/Bob"><span class="yr-player-mark" aria-hidden="true">BO</span><span class="yr-player-name">Bob</span></a>
<span class="yr-srow-val"><span class="yr-sr">Wagered: </span>$3,000</span>
<span class="yr-srow-prize"><span class="yr-sr">Prize: </span>$60</span>
</li></ol>
<p class="yr-nomatch" id="yr-no-match" hidden>No players match that search.</p>
<p class="yr-search-status" id="yr-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>


</div></div>
<footer class="viewer-panel-footer"><span><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 8 9 8 9s8-4 8-9V6Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg>Your credits and claims stay with this community.</span><a href="/help/support?audience=viewer&amp;return=%2Fboard%2520fixture%2Fleaderboard">How YourRank works <svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></footer>
</main>
<aside class="viewer-overview" aria-label="Selected community overview"><section class="viewer-rail-panel viewer-credit-panel"><div class="viewer-rail-head"><h2>Your Balance</h2></div><p>Sign in to see your credits in this community.</p><a class="yr-btn" href="/board%20fixture/me#membership-code">Sign in <svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></section>
<section class="viewer-card viewer-next-reward"><div class="viewer-card-head"><h2>Your next reward</h2><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="5" rx="1.5"/><path d="M5 12v9h14v-9M12 7v14m0-14C7 8 4 3 7 2c3-1 5 5 5 5Zm0 0c5 1 8-4 5-5-3-1-5 5-5 5Z"/></svg></div><p>Sign in to see your reward progress.</p></section>



<div class="viewer-scope-help"><svg class="viewer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 8 9 8 9s8-4 8-9V6Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg><p><strong>Your membership, your history.</strong>Credits and claims are kept separate for every community you join.</p></div></aside><div class="viewer-site-footer"><footer class="yr-foot">
<p class="yr-fine">Credits are free loyalty points earned from channel-point rewards. No purchase, no cash value, no cashout.</p>
<div class="yr-foot-bar">
